@page "/components/lightbox-item"

<PageTitle>Lightbox Item</PageTitle>

<h1>Lightbox Item <ComponentBadges Tag="wa-lightbox-item" /></h1>
<p>One image or video of a <a href="components/lightbox"><code>WaLightbox</code></a> gallery; its content is the thumbnail that opens the lightbox at this item. <code>&lt;wa-lightbox-item&gt;</code> wrapped by <code>WaLightboxItem</code>.</p>

<ExampleSection Title="Image" Code="@ImageExample">
    <p>
        <code>Src</code> is the full-size image and the content is its thumbnail, which links to the full-size image, so the
        item still works before the component loads. <code>Width</code> and <code>Height</code> give the full-size
        dimensions, so the lightbox can size the slide before the image loads, and <code>Caption</code> shows plain text
        with the item in the lightbox.
    </p>
    <WaLightbox Label="Kitten photo">
        <WaLightboxItem Src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591871937573-74dbba515c4c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80"
                        Caption="Fluffy and gray" Width="1200" Height="800">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591871937573-74dbba515c4c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=400&q=60"
                 alt="A white and grayish kitten"
                 style="width: 100%; max-width: 16rem; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; border-radius: var(--wa-border-radius-m); object-fit: cover;" />
        </WaLightboxItem>
    </WaLightbox>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Responsive Images" Code="@ResponsiveExample">
    <p>
        <code>SrcSet</code> offers the full-size image at more than one resolution; the lightbox picks a source for the size
        it shows the image at, and a sharper one when it is zoomed in. <code>Sizes</code> overrides that choice.
    </p>
    <WaLightbox Label="Kitten photo">
        <WaLightboxItem Src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80"
                        SrcSet="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80 1200w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&h=1600&q=80 2400w"
                        Caption="On the lookout" Width="2400" Height="1600">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=400&q=60"
                 alt="A gray tabby kitten looking down"
                 style="width: 100%; max-width: 16rem; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; border-radius: var(--wa-border-radius-m); object-fit: cover;" />
        </WaLightboxItem>
    </WaLightbox>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Video" Code="@VideoExample">
    <p>
        <code>Type</code> <code>WaLightboxItemType.Video</code> plays the video in the lightbox. The thumbnail gets a play
        button, which <code>PlayIconName</code> (or <code>PlayIconContent</code>) replaces, and becomes the video's poster.
    </p>
    <WaLightbox Label="Videos">
        <WaLightboxItem Type="WaLightboxItemType.Video" Src="https://uploads.webawesome.com/02-using-kits-in-your-project.mp4"
                        Caption="Using kits in your project" PlayIconName="circle-play">
            <img src="https://uploads.webawesome.com/fa-part-2.jpg" alt="Title card of the video Using kits in your project"
                 style="width: 100%; max-width: 16rem; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: var(--wa-border-radius-m); object-fit: cover;" />
        </WaLightboxItem>
    </WaLightbox>
</ExampleSection>

<ExampleSection Title="Without a Thumbnail" Code="@WithoutThumbnailExample">
    <p>
        An item without content isn't shown on the page, but it still appears in the lightbox. <code>Thumbnail</code> gives
        it an image for the thumbnail strip and a placeholder while it loads, and <code>Alt</code> its alternative text.
    </p>
    <WaLightbox Label="Kitten photos" WithThumbnails="true" Open="@hiddenOpen" OnHide="@(() => hiddenOpen = false)">
        <WaLightboxItem Src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80"
                        Thumbnail="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529778873920-4da4926a72c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=400&q=60"
                        Alt="A gray tabby kitten looking down" Width="1200" Height="800" />
        <WaLightboxItem Src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547191783-94d5f8f6d8b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&h=800&q=80"
                        Thumbnail="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547191783-94d5f8f6d8b1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=400&q=60"
                        Alt="A kitten walking toward the camera on top of a pallet" Width="1200" Height="800" />
    </WaLightbox>
    <WaButton StartIconName="images" OnClick="@(() => hiddenOpen = true)">Show the photos</WaButton>
</ExampleSection>

